ovided by the client and is guided by market data and similar cases from Kyndryl's experience. The estimate and commercial terms does not represent an exercise to create a detailed solution specific to this client's circumstances, and as such does not represent a commitment by Kyndryl.  </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1200"><a:latin typeface="TWK Everett" panose="020B0204000000000000" pitchFamily="34" charset="77"/></a:rPr><a:t>A formal study of the client's current operations is required before a formal price can be released. Once said study has been carried out, a formal proposal will be prepared at the client's request. That price may be higher or lower than the estimate presented here.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1200"><a:latin typeface="TWK Everett" panose="020B0204000000000000" pitchFamily="34" charset="77"/></a:rPr><a:t>This estimate shall not be disclosed outside Intact Insurance UK  and shall not be duplicated, used or disclosed in whole or in part for any purpose other than to evaluate the estimate.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US"/><a:t>Suggested replacement:</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" marR="0" lvl="0" indent="0" algn="l" defTabSz="914400" rtl="0" eaLnBrk="1" fontAlgn="auto" latinLnBrk="0" hangingPunct="1"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="100000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcBef><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcAft><a:buClrTx/><a:buSzTx/><a:buFontTx/><a:buNone/><a:tabLst/><a:defRPr/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"><a:latin typeface="TWK Everett" panose="020B0204000000000000" pitchFamily="34" charset="77"/></a:rPr><a:t>*This estimate is indicative only, excludes VAT and expenses, and is based on preliminary client inputs and comparable Kyndryl engagements; it does not constitute a detailed solution or any commercial commitment. A formal assessment of the client’s operations is required before confirming pricing, after which a full proposal will be provided and final costs may vary. This estimate is confidential to Intact Insurance UK and must not be shared or used for any purpose other than its evaluation.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-GB" sz="1200"><a:latin typeface="TWK Everett" panose="020B0204000000000000" pitchFamily="34" charset="77"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="Slide Number Placeholder 3"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{24E17ADD-2DCC-AE5C-8FF3-9CD6528C01DA}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="sldNum" sz="quarter" idx="5"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:fld id="{2BA7E1BB-25B4-574B-B089-309528012E51}" type="slidenum"><a:rPr lang="en-US" smtClean="0"/><a:pPr/><a:t>6</a:t></a:fld><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="1133708832"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:notes>